## Overview
As innovative educators guided by the mission of Ramapo College, we provide co-curricular programs, activities and services to promote student learning and success. We support the development of students as globally conscious citizens and active partners in our communities. Through these efforts we foster inclusive environments where students can explore their identities and celebrate diversity. By challenging and supporting individuals, clubs, and organizations, we empower students to live and lead with integrity. Two young women stand smiling in front of a display with signs about voting rights and justice. The room has purple lighting, and protest-style posters are visible in the background. (https://www.ramapo.edu/ccec/) Civic & Community Engagement Center (https://www.ramapo.edu/ccec/) Four young women stand behind a table with honeycomb frames and beekeeping materials, next to a large sign reading “Welcome to our Hive!” with bee decorations, outdoors on a paved path. (https://www.ramapo.edu/clubs/) Clubs and Organizations (https://www.ramapo.edu/clubs/) Two people stand behind a table filled with assorted snacks and chips in a room with office supplies and a water cooler in the background. Both are smiling and facing the camera. (https://www.ramapo.edu/csi/commuter-affairs/) Commuter Affairs (https://www.ramapo.edu/csi/commuter-affairs/) Five Ramapo Greek life students standing outside pointing to a few Greek banners (https://www.ramapo.edu/greek/) Fraternity & Sorority Life (https://www.ramapo.edu/greek/) Two women hang white t-shirts on a clothesline outdoors. One shirt reads My Body My Choice. Trees, grass, and a building are visible in the background on a sunny day. (https://www.ramapo.edu/student-affairs/ovp/) Office of Violence Prevention (https://www.ramapo.edu/student-affairs/ovp/) Six people stand side by side indoors, each holding a plaque award and smiling. An American flag and a Ramapo College banner are visible in the background. (https://www.rama