## Open Public Records Act
Download OPRA Request Form (https://www.ramapo.edu/opra/wp-content/uploads/sites/48/2025/01/OPRA-Request-Form.pdf) (PDF) Download OPRA Request Instructions (https://www.ramapo.edu/opra/wp-content/uploads/sites/48/2025/01/OPRA-Request-Instructions.pdf) (PDF) OPRA (https://www.ramapo.edu/opra/wp-content/uploads/sites/48/2013/04/opra.jpg) The Open Public Records Act, N.J.S.A. 47:1 A-1, outlines the types of records that are open to the public and procedures for requesting such records. Ramapo College of New Jersey, in compliance with the Open Public Records Act (OPRA), hereby provides notice that all College records other than those identified by OPRA as exempt or as exceptions to disclosure and those protected from disclosure by federal or other State law, will be available to the public according to the procedures described above. The Government Records Council’s Website www.state.nj.us/grc (http://www.state.nj.us/grc) contains useful information on the law. Submit Request: Please complete and sign the attached OPRA Request Form and submit it as follows: Email: records@ramapo.edu (mailto:records@ramapo.edu) Mail: Custodian of Public Records, 505 Ramapo Valley Road, M-220, Mahwah, NJ 07430 RECORD ACCESS: The College is opened: Monday through Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. from the week before Labor Day to the week of Commencement, Monday through Thursday 8:00am to 5:15pm week after Commencement until the week before Labor Day. OPRA requests will not be processed when the College is Closed. The College is closed the week between Christmas and New Years. A person denied access to a properly requested government record has the right to appeal a denial of, or failure to provide requested information by filing a complaint with the Government Records Council. U.S. Mail: P.O. Box 819, Trenton, NJ 08625, or Website: http://www.state.nj.us/grc/ E-mail: grc@dca.state.nj.us (mailto:grc@dca.state.nj.us) Toll free telephone: 1-866-850-0511 Fax: 1-609-633-6337 File suite in Superior Court where the denial occurred. * Fees may apply for processing information request.
