## Purpose of EOF Program
The Educational Opportunity Fund (EOF) Program at Ramapo College of New Jersey provides meaningful access to higher education for qualified New Jersey students impacted by historical poverty. The EOF experience offers comprehensive support services and alumni connections to promote retention and progress through graduation.
## EOF Services
Our office welcomes both in-person and virtual appointments. For current students, please get in touch with your EOF Advisor or make an appointment in Connect. For general questions, please call our office or email us. Phone: (201) 684-7541 | Location: D-101 | Email: EOFdesk@ramapo.edu (mailto:EOFdesk@ramapo.edu) Academic Year Hours: Monday – Friday, 8:30 AM – 4:30 PM Summer Hours: Monday – Thursday, 8:00 AM – 5:15 PM
## Give to the EOF Program
